{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026K0hHRu2fMA1793256828.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>元朗八月有大狗咬死兩隻小狗，大狗主人被加控殘酷對待動物罪， 押後明年1月再訊。</p><p></p><p>案情指被告52歲伍瑞庭，今年7月10日和8月17日容許一隻雄性混種狗，無用一條2米以下的狗帶牽引進入或留在元朗GRAND YOHO公眾地方附近。</p><p></p><p>案件上午在屯門裁判法院再提訊，控方申請加控一項殘酷對待動物罪，即沒有妥善管束狗隻，導致另外兩隻狗受到不必要痛楚，獲裁判官批准，押後至明年1月7日再訊，被告獲准繼續保釋。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T08:01:29.976624+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":197,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T04:17:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T00:58:12.035943+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T07:58:21.780152+00:00","content_hash":"a760874a5036f73d7856e4829ca046f559b17011cd220e184120922b60310553","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T08:01:29.976624+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}